<title>COSTA RICA: SOCCER-COSTA RICA BEAT CAMEROON 5-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COSTA RICA BEAT CAMEROON 5-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rica beat Cameroon 5-0 (halftime 3-0) in a friendly on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Paulo Cesar Wanchope (22, 38 and 43), Austin Berry (55 and 67)</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
